{"verdict":"correct","reason":"at least one candidate scored >= upper threshold 0.7","scored":[{"node":{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters","title":"UK: Beyond Offer Letters","level":"session","summary":"A UK-focused panel (Jasmine Bual/QMUL, Wai Wah Tsang/Warwick, Jasminder Khanna/Graysham Global, Nick Skeavington/Exeter, moderated by Bhavya Goyal) traced how outbound Indian student numbers grew roughly tenfold -- from 131,000 in 2005 to over 1.3 million by 2025 -- while UK university capacity stayed comparatively fixed, forcing far more selective screening. The panel covered UKVI's tightened Basic Compliance Assessment, universities' adoption of the Enroly CAS Shield platform for pre-CAS financial and credibility checks, and NBFCs (Credila, Avanse) now capping lending by university. Wai Wah Tsang's recurring 'gym membership' analogy -- that an offer is only the entry ticket, not the outcome -- framed the panel's advice to counselors to prioritize institutional fit and career-support usage over rankings alone.","children":[{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters/topic:uk","title":"UK","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters","sessionRefs":["2026-07-15-creative-futures","2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters/topic:enroly-cas-shield","title":"Enroly CAS Shield","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters/topic:cas","title":"CAS","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters/topic:nbfcs","title":"NBFCs","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters/topic:credila","title":"Credila","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters/topic:avanse","title":"Avanse","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters/org:the-outreach-collective-toc","title":"The Outreach Collective (TOC)","level":"org","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters"}}],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters"}},"score":0.9,"reason":"The document directly states what a panel of speakers discussed regarding UK student visas, including UKVI's tightened Basic Compliance Assessment and universities' adoption of platforms for pre-CAS financial and credibility checks, which are key aspects of the visa process."},{"node":{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload","title":"UK: Beyond Offer Letters (re-uploaded copy)","level":"session","summary":"This file is a re-upload of the same 3rd-August UK panel (Bhavya Goyal moderating Jasmine Bahl/QMUL, Wai Wah Tsang/Warwick, Jasminder Khanna/Graysham Global, Nick Skevington/Exeter) but with a shorter captured transcript (49 paragraph turns versus 154 in the primary file) -- likely a partial or differently-clipped recording of the same live session, per the note already carried in KNOWLEDGE-BANK.md ('also appears duplicated under filename UK-Beyond-Offer-Letters -- same session, likely re-uploaded'). Content overlaps the primary 03rd-August session on the 131,000-to-1.3-million growth figure and Wai Wah Tsang's 'gym membership' analogy for what an offer letter actually buys a student.","children":[{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload/topic:august-uk","title":"August UK","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload/topic:bhavya-goyal","title":"Bhavya Goyal","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload/topic:jasmine-bahl","title":"Jasmine Bahl","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload/topic:qmul","title":"QMUL","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload/topic:wai-wah-tsang","title":"Wai Wah Tsang","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload","sessionRefs":["2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:08/session:2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload/topic:warwick","title":"Warwick","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-08-03-uk-beyond-offer-letters-reupload","sess