in two parallel tracks -- sourcing funds and moving funds -- starting at the university-shortlisting stage, not after an offer arrives.","children":[{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:05/session:2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex/topic:frr-forex","title":"FRR Forex","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex","sessionRefs":["2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:05/session:2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex/topic:hdfc-credila","title":"HDFC Credila","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex","sessionRefs":["2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:05/session:2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex/topic:flywire","title":"Flywire","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex","sessionRefs":["2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:05/session:2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex/topic:fema","title":"FEMA","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex","sessionRefs":["2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:05/session:2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex/topic:inr","title":"INR","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex","sessionRefs":["2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex","2026-07-30-in-focus-3"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:05/session:2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex/topic:section","title":"Section","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex","sessionRefs":["2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:05/session:2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex/org:the-outreach-collective-toc","title":"The Outreach Collective (TOC)","level":"org","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex"}}],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-05-08-funding-dreams-loans-forex"}},"score":0,"reason":"The document discusses education financing, including loans, scholarships, and currency exchange, but it does not mention UK student visas or any related discussions by speakers."},{"node":{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:07/session:2026-07-08-beyond-black-robes-law-careers","title":"Beyond Black Robes: Rethinking Careers in Law","level":"session","summary":"Deepu Krishna (BITS Law School) and Harsh Vardhan Tiwari (O.P. Jindal Global University) discussed evolving legal-career paths beyond litigation, moderated by Anchal Shroff. They advised that students planning to practice law in India should do their UG law degree in India, since practicing there after a foreign law degree requires a mandatory 2-year Bar Council of India bridge course. They also discussed AI's growing role in the profession, noting that firms including Shardul Amarchand Mangaldas have adopted tools like Harvey AI, and that Claude for Legal (from Anthropic) is used similarly for case summaries and first drafts, while strategic judgment and advocacy remain squarely human tasks.","children":[{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:07/session:2026-07-08-beyond-black-robes-law-careers/topic:india","title":"India","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-07-08-beyond-black-robes-law-careers","sessionRefs":["2026-07-08-beyond-black-robes-law-careers"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:07/session:2026-07-08-beyond-black-robes-law-careers/topic:ug","title":"UG","level":"topic","summary":"","children":[],"evidence":{"sessionRef":"2026-07-08-beyond-black-robes-law-careers","sessionRefs":["2026-07-08-beyond-black-robes-law-careers"]}},{"node_id":"toc/year:2026/month:07/session:2026-07-08-beyond-black-robes-law-careers/topic:bar-council","title":"Bar Council","level":"topic","summary":